{"availability":"available","full":"ArshadChowdhury/dummy-daraz-react","name":"dummy-daraz-react","description":"A react e-Commerce app built with Vite, I was experimenting with vite, react slick slider and font awesome. The main focus was to learn these better and have a great project at the end of the learning of these stuff. It has a working cart all across the page. We can add delete quantity of items in cart page as well.","category":"Business","language":"JavaScript","stars":10,"forks":7,"created":"2022-12-21T21:17:46Z","updated":"2025-12-19T15:11:33Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://react-daraz-clone.netlify.app/","topics":["ecommerce","ecommerce-website","react","react-router"],"demo":"https://react-daraz-clone.netlify.app/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T11:07:32.560Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-10T11:07:32.560Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-10T11:07:32.560Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-10T11:07:32.560Z","stars":10,"forks":7}],"technologies":["React"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["This Daraz clone e-commerce site is built with Vite and ReactJS.","I've used some react hooks, react-slick-slider, font awesome, react-routers, react hot toast and some other packages in here which made the site look good & feel good while using it.","The navigation feels very smooth because of react router dom, the site doesn't actually reload, it just changes some components which are necessary and stated inside by me. I wrote most of the functions in App.jsx and then sent them down to child components as props and used them in the components."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ArshadChowdhury/dummy-daraz-react/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"6f573ed9d5d8f2b3c708788683bdc7754579bd6ea3a4680d9a46b8df4ce221ec","extractedAt":"2026-10-10T11:07:32.686Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T11:07:32.686Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"This Daraz clone e-commerce site is built with Vite and ReactJS